WEBVTT

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:54.910
Is this a hospital?

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:05.280
Oh, looks like you're awake.

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:13.230
Doctor, am I...

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:16.950
It is truly unfortunate, but one had

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:19.240
to be removed completely.

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:38.850
Damn you!

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:45.970
How dare you?!

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:48.730
I remember that he called himself DT!

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:50.350
I swear!

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:53.390
I am going to get you back 
for this humiliation!

00:02:53.390 --> 00:02:56.730
Be ready when I come for you, DT!

00:02:58.310 --> 00:02:59.990
I don't get it!

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:03.020
Why do I have to live my days here

00:03:03.020 --> 00:03:04.740
as the servant of this brat?!

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:07.380
I have the right to choose my work

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:09.210
and I don't recall signing any contract!

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:10.750
Who's responsible for this?!

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:13.360
I guess you are.

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:15.750
You're still talking about this?

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:17.260
You keep complaining about something

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.020
that's already in the past.

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:20.760
You're so petty.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:24.760
I'm bringing it up again 
because it's important!

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:27.410
But it's an official order 
of the St. Piria Empire,

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:30.150
issued directly by the princess.

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:32.940
At this point, your 
opinion has no weight.

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:35.730
That's why I'm complaining like this!

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:36.780
Isn't there a cooling off period

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:38.540
or a customer support or something?!

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:41.820
Besides, I have the important mission

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:44.470
of returning to my own world.

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:47.430
I'm sorry, but I just don't 
have time to deal with you.

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:50.000
Oh, the world you said you came from.

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:52.560
Right! It might sound weird,

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:55.460
but I live in a different 
world than you.

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:58.460
Ditto, right back at you.

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:01.460
Jeez, sorry for being a commoner!

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:04.290
Hearing it from a real 
princess kind of hurts.

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:06.140
I said it because I figured it might.

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:09.470
You're really unpleasant.

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:13.810
But how do you plan on getting back?

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:14.980
Well...

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:17.470
You don't know how to get back,

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:19.400
you don't have any resources 
for your journey,

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.170
and you don't know anything 
about this world.

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:24.100
I can't say that wanting to split from us

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:26.410
sounds like a smart move.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:28.500
He's right.

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:30.160
Since you have no other leads,

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:31.750
why don't you just go with our flow?

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:34.180
As long as you are my servant,

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:36.250
you won't have to worry 
about your next meal.

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:41.170
So what? I'm supposed to 
thank you for feeding me?!

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.760
I'm sorry, but I can't stand it

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:46.260
when others try to 
make decisions for me!

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:47.510
Thanks for the food!

00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:53.400
So what's our plan now?

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:56.520
We'll keep heading for the capital.

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:59.040
Moving with a large entourage will just

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:01.190
draw unwanted attention to us again.

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:03.490
So we should continue to move covertly

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:04.570
with a minimal crew.

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:06.090
You're right.

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:09.990
But I wonder who those guys were.

00:05:24.310 --> 00:05:26.430
Everybody, I...

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:29.330
We're glad you're safe, Erec-sama!

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:30.550
We were worried!

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:33.870
I bet they fought dirty, right?

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:39.260
I...

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:42.070
...have good subordinates.

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:43.940
Oh, come on!

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:46.540
No matter what happens, nothing would

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:47.560
ever shake our ballsiness!

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:50.160
<i>Balls, balls, balls...</i>

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:50.180
Erec-sama?

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:52.080
Oh, it's nothing.

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:54.630
And I'm sure you're 
not going to retreat

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:56.290
after being crushed, right?

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:58.670
We are also angry!

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:02.560
Let's unleash all that pent up anger!

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:07.220
Oh lord, release us 
from this nad-sty memory

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:09.970
and guide us to victory and glory!

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:12.930
That speech was worthy 
of the family jewels.

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:14.870
Praying isn't necessary.

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:18.130
Erec-sama was only defeated 
by coins-idence, by coins-idence!

00:06:18.130 --> 00:06:20.100
I see, by coins-idence.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:21.660
By coins-idence then.

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:23.730
E-Enough...

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:26.770
I appreciate your sentiments.

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:29.610
There will be a briefing in two hours.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:32.470
I want you all to be prepared.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:40.120
<i>Isn't he kind of lopsided?</i>

00:06:56.970 --> 00:07:00.060
Hi! Will you accompany me for a bit?

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:07.650
Why do I have to tag 
along for your errand?

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:09.690
Well, everything's a 
learning experience.

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:11.280
You should see as much as you can,

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:13.920
no matter what you choose to do next.

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:17.380
I guess there's no RPG without tasks.

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:21.620
Hey, Kon, do you really hate 
the idea of going with us?

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.520
It's not about you guys,

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:25.630
I just hate being shoehorned 
into something!

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:28.280
I really don't like the 
type of main character

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:30.130
who doesn't make their own decisions.

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:33.680
The princess is dishonest, 
so she said it like that,

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:37.640
but I think she thinks 
you're really reliable.

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:40.450
Well, even then...

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:44.310
You might not know it, 
but in this world,

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:46.210
becoming a knight is a big deal.

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:47.650
It's a prestigious job.

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:50.110
I want a job change.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:53.320
If possible, a government 
employee or system engineer.

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:55.160
Giver mint?

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:57.450
Uh, never mind!

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:59.640
Anyway, I don't want to do it!

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:03.670
I guess you're also dishonest, 
like the princess.

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:07.750
Here we are.

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:09.800
What is this?

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:12.090
A carrier pigeon, don't you know them?

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:15.340
I do know them, 
but what's with this size?

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:17.180
It's needlessly huge!

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:19.390
I'm sending out a letter

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:23.730
to update various contacts.

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:30.410
Even feeding them looks 
like a huge task.

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:33.320
In this world, these are the 
main communication method.

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:36.660
So there are no phones or email.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:39.830
In the capital they have something 
called Alma Communication,

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:42.580
but they won't get it out 
here for a long time.

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:56.930
Erecpyle Dukakis, I've been 
waiting for you. Report.

00:08:57.820 --> 00:08:59.930
We are currently searching for the

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:02.280
36th princess of the St. Piria Empire.

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:04.080
As soon as we have her location,

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:06.080
we will immediately move out.

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:10.280
Please rest assured that we 
will complete this mission

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:11.400
without fail.

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:16.500
Listen, in order to bring 
about the desired reality,

00:09:17.260 --> 00:09:19.000
we must stop the progress of

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.910
the moderate faction 
as soon as possible.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:25.460
I am sure I did not need 
to remind you of that.

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:31.710
<i>I will settle this before
 my superiors find out.</i>

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:34.720
<i>I have to get the Alma 
Gear back from DT.</i>

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:41.680
<i>Not that he could actually do 
anything with that weapon.</i>

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:51.370
It looks like this is 
no ordinary sword.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:52.690
Seriously...

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:54.860
It looks way too expensive for a sword

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.610
I got my hands on in such an ordinary way.

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:57.860
You can't have it though.

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:59.200
Look at this.

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:01.080
A trigger?

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:04.200
I noticed that. 
What's it doing on a sword?

00:10:04.730 --> 00:10:06.210
And this.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:07.790
It's a decoration, right?

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:10.560
No, it's an Alma Crystal.

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:12.960
Alma what?

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:15.700
It's the super ore of this world.

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:18.350
It's mainly used as an energy source,

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:21.630
but you rarely see crystals this big.

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:24.630
That means I can sell it for a lot!

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:27.230
Right. But before that,

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:31.690
we need to figure out how it works.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:33.570
What are you going to do?

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:35.190
Test the blade.

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:38.860
I believe it works by 
adding Alma Energy to

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:41.700
the sword thus creating 
a powerful attack.

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:43.700
Why do you think that?

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:45.810
Because I see no other reason

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:48.160
why we were defeated so easily.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:52.040
Ah, you're a sore loser.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:13.650
W-Whoa...

00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:17.010
No, that was just a normal hit.

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:20.050
I didn't even feel the 
slightest bit of Alma Energy.

00:11:20.050 --> 00:11:22.660
I still think that was amazing.

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:27.490
It's no good, it won't react at all.

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:30.630
Maybe it's broken. Give it here.

00:11:30.630 --> 00:11:31.170
Hey!

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:36.550
Work, damn you!

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:38.590
This ain't the time to be broken! Hey!

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:40.310
Stop!

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:42.400
You'll really break it!

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:45.780
To be honest, I hated carrying 
around this heavy thing!

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:49.980
If it's broken, I'm just going 
to sell this crystal and...

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:51.350
S-Stop it.

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:52.000
Damn you!

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:53.520
Hey, Kon.

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:56.160
I want to talk to you.

00:11:57.540 --> 00:11:59.030
Follow me.

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:13.260
What did you bring me 
all the way here for?

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:15.420
I told you that I wanted 
to talk to you, you moron.

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:20.080
Then talk already. You know I...

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:22.680
...have a lot of time, I guess.

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:28.070
This world is precariously 
balanced right now.

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:30.710
If that balance were to 
be upset even a little,

00:12:30.710 --> 00:12:35.050
this world will break in two 
and rush towards destruction.

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:38.270
You realize that you're 
talking about something

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:40.480
rather complicated despite 
being just a kid, right?

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:42.320
Shut up and listen, you tool.

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:43.860
T-Tool?

00:12:43.880 --> 00:12:45.600
In order to prevent

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:48.120
the destruction of this world, that is, war,

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:52.080
I need to marry that Jaba-something.

00:12:52.090 --> 00:12:54.580
You told me about that 
last time, but...

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:57.330
This marriage is not 
just my personal issue,

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:59.350
it's an issue that 
affects the whole world.

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:04.180
Kon, no matter what 
happens, I cannot die.

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:07.850
So...

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:10.220
Wait a sec! Hey!

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:12.080
You've got me figured wrong!

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:15.550
I only won against that 
guy by accident.

00:13:15.550 --> 00:13:20.050
I'm not as, wait, 
I'm not strong at all!

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:21.820
What are you talking about? 
You saved us twi—

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:23.160
Will you listen?!

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:25.260
The first time I just fell from the sky!

00:13:25.260 --> 00:13:28.020
The second time he was simply an idiot!

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:54.730
This destructive power is amazing!

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:57.230
This truly is a Chariot.

00:13:57.620 --> 00:14:00.230
Come out! DT!

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:04.400
This mission seems easy.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:05.810
Don't let your guard down.

00:14:05.810 --> 00:14:08.460
You're the only one besides Erec-sama

00:14:08.460 --> 00:14:10.240
who's seen his face.

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:13.540
Yeah, I'm going to find that DT guy,

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:17.040
drag him in front of Erec-sama, 
and rake in the points.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:17.750
Right.

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:25.340
This is a message to the fighter DT!

00:14:26.100 --> 00:14:28.320
Come out right now!

00:14:28.320 --> 00:14:29.720
If you don't come out,

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:32.840
I am going to destroy this 
city along with its citizens!

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:36.130
If you don't want that, come out!

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:37.100
DT!

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:39.190
Princess, are you hurt?

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:40.350
I'm fine.

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:43.860
What's going on here?!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:46.010
It's the guys from last time.

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:47.190
And what's that thing?!

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:50.650
Pops, can you fight that thing?

00:14:50.650 --> 00:14:52.740
That'll actually be tough.

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:55.540
And with the town being held hostage...

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:56.700
DT!

00:14:56.700 --> 00:15:01.710
I am not bluffing! 
Come out and face me!

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:04.030
By the way, who's DT?

00:15:04.030 --> 00:15:05.050
This guy.

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:10.550
That bastard, stop calling me DT!

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:12.300
I might be a DT,

00:15:12.310 --> 00:15:15.310
but he has no right to call me DT!

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:17.810
So what are you going to do, DT?

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:19.940
Don't call me DT!

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:32.660
Erec-sama!

00:15:33.800 --> 00:15:36.160
We're the ones who found him!

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:38.160
Well done!

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:40.160
Now I can fight to my heart's content!

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:48.450
Listen up!

00:15:48.450 --> 00:15:52.180
Don't interfere, this is my fight!

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.180
Erec-sama!

00:15:57.490 --> 00:15:59.020
You bastard!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:00.720
It's not fair to bring 
that thing to a fight!

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:02.390
What are you, five?!

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:04.100
Say what you want!

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:09.190
No matter what you say, 
I will not forgive you!

00:16:09.490 --> 00:16:12.530
Damn, we can't even run.

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:23.210
Erec-sama, are you trying to kill us?!

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:25.710
No, I didn't mean to...

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:28.880
Did the sight get misaligned?

00:16:35.280 --> 00:16:37.050
Seriously, are you trying to kill us?!

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:39.520
This can't be! Why?!

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:43.060
<i>One had to be removed completely.</i>

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:46.060
<i>Removed completely...</i>

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:51.180
Kon, it looks like he's got some 
sort of problem over there.

00:16:51.180 --> 00:16:52.030
This is our chance!

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:54.710
Looks like it, good luck.

00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:55.660
You go.

00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:57.150
Wait, what?!

00:16:57.150 --> 00:16:59.530
If you use that sword, you might

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:01.910
even be able to destroy that weapon.

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:03.600
Did you say might?!

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:07.420
Kon, you showed us two 
miracles already.

00:17:07.740 --> 00:17:09.430
Do it a third time!

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:13.090
I've decided to bet on you!

00:17:13.110 --> 00:17:14.910
I'll open the path for you!

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:16.200
H-Hey!

00:17:18.710 --> 00:17:21.270
You fool! You're facing a Chariot!

00:17:25.380 --> 00:17:26.310
What?!

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:29.190
Now, Kon!

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:33.530
Damn it, I don't care anymore!

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:38.670
It's pointless.

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:40.840
The Alma Gear can only be used

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:43.390
by the chosen warriors, Hyperion!

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:44.710
You could never—

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.050
What?

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:58.050
This is...

00:17:58.050 --> 00:18:00.100
Alma's Light.

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:13.070
Could it be that he, 
that DT, is also a Hyperion?!

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:16.260
I don't know what's going on, 
but this works for me!

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:25.580
Uh, that doesn't count. Redo, redo!

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:29.240
What is this?!

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:31.090
It turned into a hammer?

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:37.710
Your fate has decided 
that you die here!

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:40.090
I'll end you!

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:42.350
Don't make me laugh!

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:45.850
This is good enough for you!

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:49.440
This is the end for you!

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.650
No, it isn't!

00:19:10.030 --> 00:19:11.810
Did I do it?

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:18.690
DT, you have made me angry!

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:20.880
You will pay for that

00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:23.140
with your life!

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:32.440
My balance... I can't run straight?!

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:41.780
I see. Balance, eh?

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:43.990
I've had enough!

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:45.950
I'll finish this with my next move!

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:49.300
I agree, let's finish this!

00:19:49.300 --> 00:19:51.750
But I'm the one who will win!

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:53.670
How dare you!

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:56.170
Who do you think you are?!

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:10.720
You dodged it?

00:20:10.720 --> 00:20:13.560
No, I didn't move a single step.

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:16.520
I'm sorry for ruining your 
balance by crushing your ball.

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:18.610
I'll fix that right now!

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:29.950
Erec-sama!

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:32.640
Erec-sama!

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:34.550
Oh crap!

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:37.490
DT,

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:42.030
based on Erec-sama's orders, 
we will retreat for now.

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:44.220
But the next time we meet...

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:46.520
I'm not DT,

00:20:46.520 --> 00:20:49.730
and I don't want to see you, 
so please don't come again.

00:20:49.730 --> 00:20:51.040
KT, don't.

00:20:57.970 --> 00:21:00.640
I'll have to ask you for a fight then.

00:21:01.560 --> 00:21:04.750
Why won't you listen to me?!

00:21:06.520 --> 00:21:09.620
So can't I attack them now?

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:11.290
They're all facing away, 
and one blow could—

00:21:11.300 --> 00:21:15.560
Don't do it. They're all really strong.

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:19.250
You stand no chance against 
their skill with the sword.

00:21:19.860 --> 00:21:22.760
But you know, you did well, Kon.

00:21:23.200 --> 00:21:27.590
Well, I did see that he 
wasn't in his best form.

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:30.600
You made it happen, the third miracle.

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:41.570
And?

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:43.190
I have a condition.

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:44.440
Condition?

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:46.800
I'll go with you guys for now.

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:48.850
But in exchange,

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:53.580
help me look for a way to 
get back to my world.

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:56.120
Then I'll help you.

00:21:58.130 --> 00:22:00.500
All right, then we have a deal.

00:22:00.970 --> 00:22:02.500
Deal.

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:07.300
Well, you ought to go 
to the capital anyway.

00:22:07.310 --> 00:22:09.010
What do you mean?

00:22:10.460 --> 00:22:11.940
There might be a way

00:22:11.940 --> 00:22:15.020
to get back to your 
world in the capital.

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:27.710
Now, go.

00:22:36.270 --> 00:22:38.280
Do your work for me.

00:24:09.970 --> 00:24:24.800
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:10.650 --> 00:24:12.480
We encountered a strange animal

00:24:12.480 --> 00:24:14.300
on the way to the capital.

00:24:14.620 --> 00:24:17.260
But for some reason, 
Kon could not get along

00:24:17.260 --> 00:24:19.810
with this animal and absolutely 
refused to have it join us.

00:24:19.810 --> 00:24:21.310
Kon, why?!

00:24:21.310 --> 00:24:23.800
What happened in your past?!

00:24:24.840 --> 00:24:30.230
After losing another battle against Kon,

00:24:24.840 --> 00:24:30.230
Erec has lost both halves
 of something important.

00:24:32.240 --> 00:25:00.000
In his despair, Erec tries to leave

00:24:32.240 --> 00:25:00.000
Incognito in order to go home.
